{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600120","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1360012001:0":{"text":"はははっ、実に痛快だ！さあ、座って休んでくれ。","source_cn":"哈哈，痛快痛快！几位，快坐下好好休息！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6F618C144FAB5C8D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"はははっ、実に痛快だ！さあ、座って休んでくれ。","female":"はははっ、実に痛快だ！さあ、座って休んでくれ。","variant_male_record_index":"151405","variant_female_record_index":"151406","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360012002:1":{"text":"しかし、武闘会に参加するのが目的ではないのなら、わざわざ砂漠へ何をしにきたのだ？","source_cn":"各位专程过来一趟，如果不是为了参加我们的比武，那是有什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAB66DD5B0567412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360012003:1":{"text":"ここへ来た目的を伝えると、クルーガーは胸を叩いて快諾した。","source_cn":"告知来意后，克鲁格立刻豪爽地拍着胸脯答应了我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF3308F97B9F31E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360012004:0":{"text":"なんだそんなことか！どんな毛皮が欲しいんだ？いくらでも提供するぞ！","source_cn":"放心吧！这点小事，你们要什么毛皮，我们有的是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EBB90D4D13E389B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360012005:0":{"text":"なんなら、試合に負けたババリアどもを丸坊主にしてやってもいい！","source_cn":"大不了就让比赛输了的那几个蛮血剃个光头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C1A633062B6E415","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_rec