":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1360012011:1":{"text":"大会の回数を減らせば、飽きることもないと思いますが……","source_cn":"我是觉得，你们少比几次武，就不会看腻了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2F2BBDB55277DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1360012012:1":{"text":"せっかくマーリン様が来てくれたんだし、特別な花火を作ってもらって、春焔の祝いに唯一無二の彩りを添えたいの！","source_cn":"既然梅林来了，能否请大魔法师大人，为我们的春焰庆，调配...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C202AECD537DA62","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"せっかくマーリン様が来てくれたんだし、特別な花火を作ってもらって、春焔の祝いに唯一無二の彩りを添えたいの！","female":"せっかくマーリン様が来てくれたんだし、特別な花火を作ってもらって、春焔の祝いに唯一無二の彩りを添えたいの！","variant_male_record_index":"151417","variant_female_record_index":"151418","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360012013:1":{"text":"さすがは司会者さん、そう言われるとなんだかワクワクしちゃいますね！","source_cn":"哇，瞬间就变成解说口吻了，好有煽动性！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34C92D7883BE5E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1360012014:0":{"text":"ですが、花火の色は錬金術で変えられますが、作るには大量の火薬が必要になります。","source_cn":"不过，烟花这种东西，颜色还能用炼金的方式处理，但还是需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDAFE89FA926C8A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1360012015:0":{"text":"大丈夫、火薬はたっぷりあるわ！春焔の祝いのために、ずっと前から準備してたの！","source_cn":"放心，火药管够！为了这次春焰庆，我可是很早之前就开始准备了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51C13C8AC219CFB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1360012016:1":{"text":"マンカラが生き生きとお祝いの準備について話していると、どこからか弱々しい声が聞こえてきた。","source_cn":"正在曼卡拉激情四射地阐述她为节日做的准备时，一个声音弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6320574B4B1AF352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1360012017:1":{"text":"あ、あんな……申し訳ないんやけど、その、火薬が、ちと足らんかも、しれへん……","source_cn":"抱、抱歉……可能，我是说，火药，可能，那个，有点不够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD516321BC84851A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360012018:0":{"text":"ええ！？何樽用意したと思ってるの？年始めから準備してたんだから、足りないはずないわ！","source_cn":"什么？！那么多，我准备了那么多桶！从年初就开始准备，怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x747262E2A93FF414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1360012019:0":{"text":"まさか湿気？それとも変質した？でもここは砂漠よ。そんなはずは――","source_cn":"受潮？还是变质？！不可能呀，这里是沙漠——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0A4D56D0E99453F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1360012020:1":{"text":"あ、いや……じ、実は、アロマ作るのに、ちょっとだけ倉庫から借りよう思て……","source_cn":"呃，是，是我平时做香薰会需要从仓库里取一点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FC1296424D18641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1360012021:1":{"text":"そしたら、倉庫に火薬がぎょーさんあるのを見てな。年始めから誰も使うてへんみたいやし、後で補充したらええやろと思て、ちょっと売って小銭に変えたろう思たんや……","source_cn":"但我看仓库里囤了那么多，从年初就没什么人用，我想着就偷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DC517F44083F0A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1360012022:0":{"text":"そしたら、うっかり火薬を強盗どもに盗まれてしもて……","source_cn":"结果之前“零售”的时候，就，不小心被那些强盗们给抢走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9E46AA132A30C3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1360012023:2":{"text":"ほ、ほんの少しや！ほんまに、ほんの少しやから！","source_cn":"一点点，就一点点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C591968321A7034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1360012024:1":{"text":"ほんの少しなら大丈夫ですよ。マスターは試作せずに調合できますから、多少は節約できるはずです……","source_cn":"如果只丢了一点点，应该影响也不大吧？主人的调配不需要测...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8E9DECDE6BBFA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1360012025:0":{"text":"メイメイがフォローを入れるも、マンカラはますます怒り心頭の様子だ……","source_cn":"面对我们的劝解，曼卡拉却怒火更盛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF82F461B9E37AA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1360012026:0":{"text":"正直に言いなさい……少ししか取ってないの？それとも、少ししか残ってないの！？","source_cn":"你……老实说！到底是丢了一点点，还是只剩一点点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACAFB51F2EBB17DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1360012027:1":{"text":"…………\n少ししか……残ってあらへん。","source_cn":"…………\\n后面那个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFAF9B26A2D0C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1360012028:1":{"text":"あんたねえ！毎回毎回セコいことばっかして！今度ばかりはもう許さないわ！","source_cn":"你这家伙，每次都这么贪小便宜！这次绝对不能放过你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x283497AFB5445EDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1360012029:1":{"text":"待て、マンカラ。今アクンを責めたところで問題は解決しない。まずは火薬を取り戻すのが先決だ。","source_cn":"算了，曼卡拉，现在骂阿熏也无济于事，我们先要把火药抢回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9CBCCF0FB7B9736","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1360012030:1":{"text":"強盗が火薬を手にしたとなれば、ゆゆしき事態だ。","source_cn":"否则，落在那些强盗手里，危害可是非常大的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC57303BD8FE47362","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti