","source_cn":"你带着蒙蒙，平时开销大，生活不容易，我们都知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3BC3BC5F3D4F863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1360012037:1":{"text":"薄めた薬を売ったり、少し甘い汁を吸うぐらいなら、まだ目をつぶろう。","source_cn":"平时卖点假药，兑点水，贪小便宜，这些只是小打小闹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05D316DF6C395E62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1360012038:1":{"text":"だが今回の件はさすがに度が過ぎている。とは言え、春焔の祝いも近いことだし、マーリン殿の顔を立てて、今回はこれで勘弁してやる。","source_cn":"像这次这样就太过分了，看在梅林的面子上，以及春焰庆将至...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22DE1FEE47104728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1360012039:1":{"text":"もしまた――","source_cn":"如果日后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945FCEC0FD1391A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1360012040:0":{"text":"に、二度とせえへん！今回の費用も全部ワイが出す！","source_cn":"绝、绝对不会再犯了！这次的所有费用，我、我全包了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF60D4434835D775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1360012041:1":{"text":"そう言って、アクンは泣きそうな顔をしながら、材料の手配に向かった。","source_cn":"阿熏哭丧着脸，垂头丧气地去筹办香料了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED5AFB5040F